#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = rene kanter i spillets renderstørrelse. DLSS = det samme, og opskalerer, når spillets "
"Skalering er under 100 %. Mix = spillets eget TAA blandet med DLAA / DLSS: roligere, lidt "
"blødere. fra = spillets eget billede. Gemmes med det samme."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Hvor meget af mixet der er spillets TAA, 0 - 100 % i trin på 10 %: mere = roligere og blødere, "
"mindre = skarpere. Vises, mens Tilstand er Mix, eller en deling har en Mix-side. Ingen ekstra "
"pris."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Forindstillinger til dit grafikkort. høj = alt er slået til (model 1). middel = model 2, en "
"lettere glas- og hegnsrettelse, spejle uden Følg bevægelige dele. lav = også ingen Udjævn spejle, "
"ingen glas- og hegnsrettelse, VR-område 60 %. Ændrer aldrig en indstilling, du selv har sat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = flest detaljer, skarpeste tekst, omkring 1,6 gange GPU'en af 2. 2 (E) = afbalanceret, "
"færrest spor bag trafik: start her. 3 (F) = roligst på hegn og ledninger, kan udtvære bevægelige "
"detaljer, samme pris som 2. 4 (M) = tungest (omkring 5 gange), kun til tests i flad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Billedkvalitet: skærpning, teksturskarphed, glas- og hegnsrettelsen, lyssporrettelsen og "
"DLAA-området. Højre åbner gruppen, Venstre lukker den; den starter lukket, hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Skærper billedet efter DLAA, 0 (fra) til 1,0. Hæv, hvis billedet er blødt; for højt giver lyse "
"kanter. Koster ca. 0,1 ms; 0 springer trinnet over."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Skærpningens rækkevidde, 1 til 4 px: lille = fine detaljer, stor = kraftigere kanter. Ret, hvis "
"den virker for fin eller grov; et billede større end skærmen (VR) kræver mere end 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Skarpere tekst i teksturer (vejskilte, instrumentbræt, GPS). 0 = fra; mere negativ = skarpere, "
"men mere flimmer på hegn; prøv -0,5 til -1, hvis tekst er sløret. Koster næsten intet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Det samme for trådhegn, græs og blade: hæv mod 0, hvis hegn flimrer, sænk, hvis græs ser blødt "
"ud. samme = følger rækken ovenfor. Virker kun, mens Teksturskarphed ikke er 0. Koster næsten "
"intet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Ledninger, hegn og ruder behandles som det, der er foran, ikke som det, du ser igennem dem, så de "
"ikke udtværes, når du bevæger dig. Slå det fra, hvis du ikke ser udtværing dér: sparer 0,02 - "
"0,06 ms pr. øje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Forhindrer, at gadelygtes og bilers lysglød efterlader et spor, når du bevæger dig: gløden tegnes "
"på ny i hvert billede i stedet for at blive blandet med ældre billeder. Trin på 25 %; sænk det, "
"hvis lygteglød flimrer, 0 = fra. Koster omkring 0,05 - 0,2 ms pr. øje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: kun midten af hvert øje får DLAA (20 til 100 %); kanten beholder spillets billede. Sænk for "
"en tungere model eller flere fps; 40 % koster ca. 40 % af modellen. Gælder også "
"garage-/hovedmenu-lastbilen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Hvordan DLAA håndterer bevægelige dele og lastbilspejle. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre lukker den; "
"den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA følger hver bevægelig ting for sig (trafik, hjul, nummerplader), så det forbliver skarpt og "
"ikke efterlader spor. Slå det kun fra for at spare omkring 0,5 ms pr. øje eller for at teste: så "
"bevæger alt sig med kameraet, og trafik udtværes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Udjævner også lastbilens spejle, så de ikke flimrer. 1 spejl = kun det største (hovedspejlet ved "
"siden af dig). alle = hvert spejl. kamera = billigst pr. spejl, trafik i bevægelse kan efterlade "
"spor i glasset; de andre følger hver bevægelig ting."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"til = hvert spejl får sit DLAA hvert 2. billede og viser det sidste rene billede imellem: ca. "
"halv spejlpris. Kanter forbliver rene; bevægelse i glasset opdateres med halv hastighed. fra = "
"hvert spejl hvert billede."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Billedhastighed og CPU: CPU-tuning, AMD-cachekerner, en fps-grænse og Lav forsinkelse (Reflex) "
"til flad, en fps-grænse til VR. Højre åbner gruppen, Venstre lukker den; den starter lukket, hver "
"gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tre CPU-kontakter sammen. Foretræk hurtige kerner: kun Intel-CPU'er med P-kerner og E-kerner. "
"Højere prioritet og ingen Windows-strømbesparelse til spillet: alle CPU'er, Intel og AMD. "
"Hjælper, når CPU'en er grænsen; ingen pris. Hver for sig i dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, "
"cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"AMD X3D-CPU'er med to kernegrupper (7950X3D, 9950X3D): holder spillet på kernerne med den store "
"3D V-Cache, som spil kan lide. Virker med det samme; fra giver spillet alle kerner tilbage. Prøv "
"det og sammenlign i en travl by. Ingen pris."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad. Holder spillet højst på denne billedhastighed: en jævn billedtid, mindre varme og "
"strøm. Sæt den lidt under, hvad din pc klarer i en travl by. Med Lav forsinkelse (Reflex) slået "
"til er det NVIDIA-driveren, der begrænser. fra = ingen grænse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad, kun NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Til = spillets billeder venter kortere, før grafikkortet "
"tegner dem: mindre forsinkelse mellem din styring og billedet, når kortet er grænsen. Boost "
"holder også kortets clockfrekvenser oppe. Samme fps; lille pris."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. halv = spillet tegner hvert 2. headsetbillede (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tredjedel = hvert 3.; "
"headsettets billedudjævning (ASW / Motion Smoothing) udfylder resten i en jævn rytme. Brug det, "
"når fps svinger. Slår Turbo fra, mens det er til."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR-fartforøgere: Turbo, foveated rendering, at springe de skjulte linsekanter over, og om OFXR "
"Bridge / VectorXR er fundet. Højre åbner gruppen, Venstre lukker den; den starter lukket, hver "
"gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo slår headsettets billedudjævning fra (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Kun VR. Til = spillet "
"holder op med at vente på headsettet i hvert billede: kun flere fps, når CPU'en er grænsen "
"(travle byer, trafik). Slå det fra, hvis billedet hakker."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Skarpt centrum, mindre detalje i kanten (kun NVIDIA RTX). Sparer GPU-tid ved høj Skalering. Kun "
"VR. Den ydre ring får én farve pr. 2 x 2 pixel; hegn, græs og blade beholder fuld detalje. Slå "
"det fra, hvis kanten ser blokket ud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Hvor stort det skarpe centrum i Foveated rendering er, 10 - 100 % i trin på 5 %: større = mere af "
"billedet skarpt, mindre besparelse; mindre = mere besparelse, lavere detalje starter tættere på "
"midten. 80 % (afbalanceret) er standard; 90 = bred, 65 = smal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Hvad Foveated rendering gør grovere. scene = kun 3D-verdenen (standard). scene + lys = også "
"spillets belysning, kun helt ude i kanten: mere besparelse. Test det: kig efter blokke i lys- "
"eller skyggekanter i siden af dit synsfelt."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Hvor grov den ydre ring i Foveated rendering er. Normal = 1 farve pr. 2 x 2 pixel (standard). "
"Stærk = pr. 4 x 2, Max = pr. 4 x 4: mere GPU-besparelse, mere blokkede kanter. Bedst med "
"eyetracking, hvor du aldrig kigger på den ydre ring."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentel. Det skarpe centrum i Foveated rendering følger dine øjne på et headset med "
"eyetracking (for eksempel Varjo); uden det bliver centrum midt i linsen. Foveated rendering skal "
"være slået til ved spillets start, ellers kræves en genstart. Koster næsten intet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Spillet springer linsehjørnerne over, du aldrig ser (headsettet melder dem), og tegner "
"færre pixels: mere GPU-luft, billedet du ser er det samme. Første aktivering kræver genstart af "
"spillet. Fra, hvis synsfeltets kant ser forkert ud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR-framegenerering af djules75, en separat download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). fundet = laget er indlæst i spillet, og modden lader dets "
"arbejde passere. Start dets tray-app før spillet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = en OpenXR-udvidelsespakke af DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"dybde, framegenerering; fundet = laget er indlæst i spillet, og modden lader dets arbejde "
"passere. Brug kun én Turbo (dens eller modden)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Hvor spillets eget VR-UI svæver (HUD, menuer). Modden skriver ændringen ind i spillets konsol for "
"dig; kræver g_developer og g_console 1 i config.cfg. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre lukker den."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Hvilket af spillets VR-UI-layouts rækkerne nedenfor flytter: kørsel (HUD'en under kørsel) eller "
"menuer (spillets menuskærme)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Flytter spillets VR-UI: højde, side, afstand, hældning, drejning, størrelse eller krumning, i små "
"trin. Spillet får hver ændring ca. 0,4 s efter dit sidste tryk: konsollen åbner og lukker sig "
"selv."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Højre: alle værdier i begge layouts tilbage til det, config.cfg havde i starten (spillet gemmer "
"sine egne værdier, når det lukker)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"En lille live-boks med fps og billedtid, også mens menuen er lukket (flad og VR): fps, ms, kun "
"tal, hver med eller uden en graf over de seneste billedtider (udsving er røde), eller kun grafen. "
"Dens GPU-pris måles. Gem beholder den."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fps-tællerens lås, placering, størrelse, farve, VR-afstand og drejning. Højre åbner gruppen, "
"venstre lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter fps-tælleren sidelæns, i % af skærmen (VR fast / fastgjort: grader omkring dig). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter fps-tælleren op / ned, i % af skærmen (VR fast / fastgjort: grader, minus = op). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gør fps-tælleren større eller mindre (0,2 .. 3,0). Hæv, hvis du ikke kan læse den i headsettet "
"eller på en stor skærm. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Farven på fps-tællerens tekst: 20 farver, hver med omrids, så den kan læses på ethvert billede "
"(sort på hvid = mørk tekst, hvid kontur). Flad og VR. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hvor lys fps-tælleren er, 10 - 100 %: 100 = farven som den er, lavere dæmper teksten (omridset "
"bliver) mod sort. Brug det til at dæmpe tælleren om natten eller i headsettet. Flad og VR. Ingen "
"omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hvor gennemsigtig hele fps-tælleren er, 10 - 100 %: 100 = massiv, lavere toner teksten OG det "
"sorte omrids ud sammen, så en dæmpet tæller ikke bliver en sort klat. Flad og VR. Ingen "
"omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Hvor langt tilbage fps-grafen viser: 2 - 60 s. Én søjle pr. tidsudsnit = dets langsomste billede, "
"så du ser udsving. Grøn = til tiden, gul = lidt langsom, rød = et hak; linjen = headsettets "
"hastighed / fps-grænse / din sædvanlige. Vises, når Fps-tæller har en graf."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Følg hoved = bevæger sig med headsettet. Fast i legerum = ét sted omkring dit sæde, "
"ignorerer førerhusets svaj. Fastgjort til køretøj = sidder fast på førerhuset og svajer med "
"(kræver DLAA + Følg bevægelige dele). Ingen pris."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, kun Fast på køretøj. Til = hver lastbil / bil beholder sin egen placering, drejning, "
"størrelse, farve, lysstyrke og tekst for fps-tælleren i førerhuset (gemmes i dlaa.ini, når menuen "
"lukkes). Fra = ét fælles sæt til alle køretøjer. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, kun Fast på køretøj. Højre = mål førerhuset igen nu (sid stille, parkeret), hvis boksen "
"sidder forkert. Venstre = dette køretøjs boks tilbage til standard (sted, drejning, størrelse, "
"farve, tekst); andre køretøjer beholder deres. Boksen står vinkelret på førerhuset."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Drejer fps-tælleren til venstre / højre om sig selv, i grader (+ = "
"forsiden drejer mod højre). Brug det til at vinkle den, når den sidder i siden. 0 = den vender "
"mod dig. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Vipper fps-tælleren, i grader (+ = toppen læner væk fra dig, som lå "
"den på instrumentbrættet). 0 = den vender mod dig. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Roterer fps-tælleren i sit eget plan, i grader (+ = med uret). 0 = "
"oprejst. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Hvor langt væk fps-tælleren svæver, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Den har samme "
"størrelse i dit syn på alle afstande; kun dybden ændres. Sæt den nær den dybde, du ser på, så du "
"kan læse den uden at fokusere om. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Panelets placering, størrelse, dybde og retning samt menutasterne. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre "
"lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter panelet sidelæns, i % af skærmen (VR fast i førerhus: grader omkring dit sæde). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Brug det, hvis panelet dækker noget, du skal bruge. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter panelet op / ned, i % af skærmen (VR fast i førerhus: grader, plus = ned). Flad og VR har "
"hver deres placering. Brug det, hvis panelet dækker noget, du skal bruge. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gør panelet større eller mindre. Hæv, hvis du ikke kan læse det, sænk, hvis det dækker for meget. "
"Flad og VR har hver deres størrelse. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Følg hoved = panelet følger headsettet. Fast i førerhus = det bliver på ét sted foran dit "
"sæde, roligt når du ser dig om; X / Y / dybde styrer så stedet (grader, meter). Kræver VR-laget "
"(standard). Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Hvor langt væk panelet svæver: i meter (0,30 - 3,00) som VR-lag, "
"standard; i px indadgående forskydning pr. øje med menu_vr_layer = 0. Samme størrelse ved enhver "
"dybde. Ret, hvis panelet er trættende at se på. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Til = panelet drejer mod dig, når du flytter det til siden, samme "
"størrelse fra alle vinkler (som VR-lag, standard, også den hovedfølgende fps-tæller); fra = et "
"fladt billede. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Kontakter til sammenligning: DLAA fra, spillets egen TAA blandet ind eller side om side, "
"ledningsrettelserne, DLAA tidligere. Intet her er nødvendigt til normal kørsel. Højre åbner "
"gruppen, Venstre lukker den."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Slår hele modden til eller fra og husker tilstanden; fra viser spillets eget billede til "
"sammenligning. Fra sparer prisen for alle dele samlet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"til = modden til venstre, spillets eget TAA til højre, til sammenligning (Delingslinjens "
"position, Deling: venstre | højre). Erstatter Mix, mens den er til. Når spillets konsol er til, "
"skifter modden spillets anti-aliasing for dig."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Hvor delingslinjen er, 0 - 100 % af bredden i trin på 5 %: til venstre for den modden DLAA / "
"DLSS, til højre spillets TAA. Bruges kun, mens Deling med spillets TAA er til."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Hvad delingen viser på sine to sider: DLAA | TAA (modden til venstre, spillets TAA til højre), "
"mix | TAA eller DLAA | mix (mix = de to blandet efter Mix-mængde). DLSS i stedet for DLAA ved "
"opskalering. Bruges kun, mens Deling med spillets TAA er til."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Tynde ledninger bevæger sig rigtigt, mens du kører: deres bevægelse spredes over hele den tynde "
"linje. til = standard. fra = kun til sammenligning; nære ledninger flimrer mere. Billedet er "
"blødt et øjeblik, når du skifter."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tynde ledninger tæller som foran på hver pixel, de rører, også hvor de kun dækker en strimmel af "
"den. til = standard. til (ingen A2C) = også for gennemsigtige kanter som blade. fra = kun til "
"sammenligning; nære ledninger flimrer mere."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentel: tegner fjerne ledninger tyndere end 1 pixel som en linje på 1 pixel, så de ikke "
"brydes i streger. Fra som standard: fjerne ledninger kan se mørkere ud eller flimre mere. Prøv og "
"sammenlign."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad: DLAA kører, før spillet tilføjer sin glød og farvelook, så vejstriber, ledninger og "
"skinner flimrer mindre. Ændr det kun til sammenligning. Bruges ikke med DLSS-opskalering eller "
"Windows HDR. Samme pris begge veje; det tager omkring et sekund at skifte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Fejlrapport: tryk to gange på optagetasten (eller Optag nu), hvor noget ser forkert ud; modden "
"skriver én zip, som du vedhæfter et GitHub-issue. Højre åbner gruppen, Venstre lukker den."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Én kontakt til den mest komplette rapport: logdetalje debug, tilbagespoling 2 s, optagelse Fuld. "
"Fra sætter rækkerne tilbage, som de var. Kun denne kontakt gemmes; de gennemtvungne værdier "
"skrives aldrig til dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Hvad der kommer i dlaa_inject.log: fra = intet; fejl = kun fejlslag (standard); advarsler = + "
"problemer, der er omgået; info = + opstart og ændringer; fejlsøgning = + statistik og "
"tidsmålinger (en smule langsommere)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Gemmer hele tiden de sidste 0,5 - 3 s af billeder på grafikkortet, så rapporten viser øjeblikket "
"FØR tasten (+ hvad DLSS fik til de sidste billeder). Koster grafikhukommelse (MB i prissøjlen) og "
"en billedkopi pr. billede. fra = ingen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Hurtig = systeminfo, logfiler, indstillinger, dit billede og DLAA fra i et par billeder (omkring "
"1 s). Fuld = + hvad DLSS fik pr. billede (farve, bevægelse, dybde) og A/B-sæt: bevægelsesvisning, "
"bevægelse fra, kun jitter (omkring 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Optagetasten. Tryk på den TO gange inden for 1 s under kørsel, hvor det går galt (første tryk gør "
"den kun klar: ét kort bip). Højre åbner siden Genveje ved dens række, så du kan ændre den."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Hvor mange optagelser der bliver i mappen dlaa_selftest ved siden af DLL'en: ældre (mappe + zip) "
"slettes, når en ny skrives. alle = slet aldrig."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Dette menus sprog. auto = spillets sprog (standard); venstre / højre vælger et andet. Linux / "
"Proton: kinesisk, japansk og koreansk kræver deres skrifttyper, se README. En lang\\<code>.po ved "
"siden af DLL'en vinder, til egne rettelser. Gem beholder den. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Hver genvej i dette menu, én linje pr. handling, med tastaturtast og controllerknap. Højre åbner "
"listen; vælg en handling med højre, og tryk derefter den nye tast eller rat-knap. Gemmes straks i "
"dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Skriver alt, der vises her, til dlaa.ini (indstillinger og panelets / fps-tællerens placering, "
"når du har flyttet dem), alle andre linjer bevares. Gør det, når du er tilfreds, ellers er "
"ændringerne væk ved næste start. Tilstanden gemmer sig selv."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Sætter hver indstilling i denne menu tilbage til, som modden leveres (model, skærpning, "
"teksturskarphed, DLAA-område, bevægelse, spejle, forindstilling, panel, fps-boks, turbo, "
"foveated, billedhastighed, CPU, logdetalje), live og i dlaa.ini, og beholder dine genveje og alle "
"andre linjer."

#. Value column (about 20 Latin characters)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Fra"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "graph only"
msgstr "kun graf"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
