#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Tilbage til hovedmenuen. %hs gør det samme på hver linje på denne side. Hver tast og "
"controllerknap undtagen de 5 menutaster når stadig spillet, mens menuen er åben, så du kan blive "
"ved med at køre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på EN ny tast eller controllerknap til %ls: enhver tast, også en anden menutast (den tages "
"fra den). Tast / knapper, der holdes nu, ignoreres, til de slippes. Esc eller Backspace "
"annullerer, det gør 10 s uden tryk også; menutaster kan ikke ryddes her."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Tryk på EN ny tast (Shift / Ctrl / Alt sammen med den giver en kombination) eller controllerknap "
"/ D-pad-retning. Tast / knapper, der holdes nu (en gearstang), ignoreres, til de slippes; akser "
"bindes aldrig. %hs eller Esc annullerer, Backspace rydder til ingen, 10 s uden tryk annullerer."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"En af de 5 taster, der styrer dette menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, og tryk derefter den nye tast eller "
"knap: de andre menutaster kan også tages. Disse linjer kan ikke ryddes, og hver af de 5 skal "
"beholde en binding (et tryk, der efterlader en anden tom, afvises). Gemmes straks i dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, og tryk derefter den nye tast eller knap: en tast erstatter "
"tastaturdelen, en controllerknap eller D-pad-retning controllerdelen. En tast / knap brugt af en "
"anden handling flyttes hertil. Gemmes straks i dlaa.ini."

